{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make advertisers disclose AI in any adverts",
        "additional_details": "\u201cAdvertising funds the systems that help shape what people see, trust and believe,\u201d said Charlotte Scaddan, UN Senior Adviser on Information Integrity.\r\n\r\n\u201cWithout swift action and guardrails, AI risks accelerating the breakdown of information ecosystem integrity. Advertisers have the power to help fix it.\u201d\r\n\r\nThe risk of false advertising grows as AI gets used more frequently. It also gives opportunity to those who wish to support brands who still use human creativity instead of gen AI.",
        "background": "Though banning AI advertising is not completely attainable, the requirement of an UK Television Generative AI disclosure in the bottom print under adverts should become a requirement. If not to disclose that the company supports gen AI, but at the very least to notify those who are against the use.",
